}

::CW_U06_L04_Q18::[MLA.CW.REV.01] Which revision best preserves voice while using feedback?{
~A. Replace the poem with a formal essay.#Incorrect. This erases the form and voice. This choice is not supported by the provided context or lesson skill; choose the option grounded in the prompt.
