~C. Ignore the unclear image.#Incorrect. Feedback identifies a real issue. This choice is not supported by the provided context or lesson skill; choose the option grounded in the prompt.
~D. Add unrelated slang.#Incorrect. This may not fit voice. This choice is not supported by the provided context or lesson skill; choose the option grounded in the prompt.
}

::CW_U06_L04_Q19::[MLA.CW.REV.01] A poem's sound is harsh, but the intended tone is gentle. What should the writer revise?{
