}

::CW_U06_L04_Q21::[MLA.CW.REV.01] Which craft area includes repetition, alliteration, and rhythm?{
~A. Character motivation.#Incorrect. That is narrative craft. This choice is not supported by the provided context or lesson skill; choose the option grounded in the prompt.
