}

::CW_U06_L04_Q23::[MLA.CW.REV.01] Which style issue should be revised before portfolio submission?{
~A. The final image supports tone.#Incorrect. This is a strength. This choice is not supported by the provided context or lesson skill; choose the option grounded in the prompt.
~B. The rhythm matches the mood.#Incorrect. This is a strength. This choice is not supported by the provided context or lesson skill; choose the option grounded in the prompt.
